        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We&rsquo;re transitioning GitHub Copilot SDK to Microsoft Copilot SDK .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-sdk-is-becoming-microsoft-copilot-sdk",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:23.465Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "What began as the SDK for the GitHub Copilot harness is becoming the programmable interface for the Microsoft Copilot harness , the shared agent foundation used across Microsoft and GitHub products.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-sdk-is-becoming-microsoft-copilot-sdk",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:23.465Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As part of this transition, we have begun updating the SDK repository to reflect the upcoming move to the Microsoft organization and begun updating branding and documentation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-sdk-is-becoming-microsoft-copilot-sdk",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:23.465Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The migration will happen in phases, so existing package names, namespaces, and some documentation may continue to reference GitHub Copilot SDK during the transition.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-sdk-is-becoming-microsoft-copilot-sdk",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:23.465Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This announcement is to share the SDK&rsquo;s direction and expanded role.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-github-copilot-sdk-is-becoming-microsoft-copilot-sdk",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-29T16:55:23.465Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Support for the Copilot SDK remains the same.",
